ed into the mortality estimates; (d) estimates using HIV/AIDS model life tables and estimates of under-five mortality (5q0) and adult mortality (45q15) with UNAIDS estimates of adult HIV prevalence, and ART coverage for children and adults.","migration":"International migration based on: (a) information on foreign-born populations from censuses and registers from major countries of destination; (b) information on the number of migrant workers or about labor migration; (c) estimates derived as the differences between overall population growth and natural increase; (d) UNHCR statistics on the number of refugees in the main countries of asylum."}},"forecastRange":{"startYear":2024,"adjusted":false,"lower80":[21546729,21883120,22215647,22556082,22905679,23282866,23647552,23997645,24349666,24712156,25064518,25406456,25804276,26224538,26628768,26986600,27321707,27642022,27938946,28256898,28565092,28877267,29181925,29432269,29742953,30051981,30283638,30533749,30795457,31049515,31338457,31697590,32003560,32272565,32562751,32882647,33178029,33334093,33436377,33529842,33630084,33733648,33884513,34045827,34165452,34273811,34280626,34272333,34275472,34311547,34433257,34541364,34528532,34434560,34388489,34397286,34448745,34500635,34420371,34327369,34282585,34421111,34579787,34475937,34535558,34562155,34339443,34225261,34169083,34029739,33789041,33642018,33516384,33135865,32739903,32663683,32731211],"upper80":[21765437,22544284,23334484,24160462,25018106,25883109,26769372,27646349,28500241,29390819,30301234,31201155,32119398,33071406,34036552,34975412,35863828,36733106,37656881,38641400,39639558,40620040,41579323,42524081,43515370,44504209,45451825,46410031,47462509,48581034,49521508,50530675,51736566,52947886,54173967,55381912,56590473,57814610,58974758,60174338,61399197,62578920,63814599,65080688,66407093,67672612,68834513,70119737,71588876,73108437,74391247,75690942,76989900,78231684,79645402,81087707,82319569,83480138,84572427,85447346,86385555,87734387,89045376,90210979,9163